or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker125","name":"Mythsa Monster","legend":"Tipplers say a relic monster of 14 ft long inhabits Mythsa Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker126","name":"Dretheirian Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 13 ft long inhabits Dretheirian Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Tharilerase Monster","legend":"Tipplers say a relic monster of 12 ft long inhabits Tharilerase Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Thenor Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 14 ft long inhabits Thenor Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Mithmelha Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 13 ft long inhabits Mithmelha Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Pilton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 ft long."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Felcested Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 ft long."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Treton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 35 ft long."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Sokesey Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 30 ft long."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Pengay Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 29 ft long."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Froihiofz Hydra","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a horrifying Hydra who inhabits Froihiofz hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Bhiagab Cyclops","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a horrifying Cyclops who inhabits Bhiagab hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Mythlumalon Ogre","legend":"Locals speak of a feared Ogre who inhabits Mythlumalon hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Raululilran Dragon","legend":"Rumors speak of a horrifying Dragon who inhabits Raululilran hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Undarakzund Dragon","legend":"Locals speak of a superior Dragon who inhabits Undarakzund hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Oseaseriar Giant","legend":"Whispers speak of a big Giant who inhabits Oseaseriar hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Nabulukkzar Troll","legend":"Tales speak of a hungry Troll who inhabits Nabulukkzar hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Eldlyn Dragon","legend":"Locals speak of a proud Dragon who inhabits Eldlyn hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Ukthelgathu Dragon","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a horrifying Dragon who inhabits Ukthelgathu hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Brorkraz Cyclops","legend":"Tipplers speak of a fat Cyclops who inhabits Brorkraz hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Nakahorus Vampire","legend":"Whispers speak of a terrifying Vampire who inhabits Nakahorus hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Ash-Khad Hydra","legend":"Legends speak of a hungry Hydra who inhabits Ash-Khad hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Anarg Banshee","legend":"Tales speak of a proud Banshee who inhabits Anarg hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Dogratemon Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gafan Blasphemy."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Evralofenor Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gafan Blasphemy."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Storest Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Anor (Human) Ancestors."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Taderanoth Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Rake (Drakonic) Deities."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Linsene Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Quenian (Elfish)ism."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Pudrock Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Anor (Human) Ancestors."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Springel Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Bonedavenese Schism."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Khundushath Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Dunirr (Dwarven) Beliefs."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Zizad Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Dunirr (Dwarven) Beliefs."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Crowdenward Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Bonedavenese Schism."},{"id":"marker158","name":"Velnavanoth Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gafan Blasphemy."},{"id":"marker159","name":"Velind Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Gafan Blasphemy."},{"id":"marker160","name":"Oalehall Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Anor (Human) Ancestors."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Karauthimor Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Rake (Drakonic) Deities."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Iunaranor Lions","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Narakinbhur Falcons","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Selhasin Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Ainoress Jaguars","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Chaulte Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Jamrion Wolfs","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Cragliivgithos Bisons","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker169","name":"Kyathlondo Badgers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker170","name":"Khathizdus Hares","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker171","name":"Wilhale Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker172","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker173","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker174","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker175","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker176","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker177","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker178","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker179","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker180","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker181","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker182","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker183","name":"Grug Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0f\udc34𐠑𐠅\udc04𐠑𐠅\udc11𐠭\ud802\ud802𐠎𐠷 \udc1e𐠬\udc1c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯\udc20\ud802𐠛𐠟\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛\ud802\ud802𐠸\ud802\ud802𐠤\ud802𐠲𐠦\udc17\ud802\ud802𐠧\ud802 \udc15\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌\udc0f\udc35\udc0b \udc13𐠂\ud802\ud802𐠲\udc01\udc32\ud802𐠓\udc25\udc2d\udc11𐠘𐠟\udc24\udc2b\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker184","name":"Inleandenat Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc03\udc13𐠪\udc2b \udc1b\udc16\udc08\ud802 \ud802𐠧\ud802𐠭\udc29\udc29\udc25𐠄\udc1a\ud802\ud802 𐠘\udc38\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc0c\ud802𐠟\ud802𐠴</div>"},{"id":"marker185","name":"Ash-Kag Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༷༉༳༾༑༜༓༑༜༊༠༙༧༪༄༱༨༈༓༂༌༥༽༒༁༖༚༩༷༤༳༁༓༜༭༧༦༐༾༬༿༗༆༭༗༇༐༰ༀ༨༜༐༯༑༇༃༃༣༭༓༦༇༨༰༃༌༫༺༼༵༯༚༂༔༩༔༂༶༐༲༂༮༪་</div>"},{"id":"marker186","name":"Canthtor Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༵༵༐༐༹༾༉༸༥༥༜༦༢༠༄༷༾༴༯༜༒༂༿༱༯༯༱༬༽༧༐༷༁༾༓༻༧༇༾༬</div>"},{"id":"marker187","name":"Tartosotnarmer Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc23\ud802\ud802𐠬𐠴𐠛\udc32𐠂\ud802𐠪\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc2b𐠊 \udc1d\ud802𐠲\udc02\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc03\ud802 \udc2c 𐠙\udc2e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟\udc0f\udc2b\udc21\udc30\ud802𐠿 𐠱\udc2c\udc21\udc16\udc15\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc32\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞𐠜\udc17𐠁\udc31\udc2c\udc1f𐠧𐠛\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker188","name":"Ellalian Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነጰ  ሐለተአነሰተከፈለሰዘወኀገገጠኀጸቀየለበተሠለፐዘገጠአሐሠ ከ ለቀአሠኀሐሐኀዐዘሠ  አሠቀለፐሰተሐፐአከደወ</div>"},{"id":"marker189","name":"Eloseanarant Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༶༮༫༯༖༽༳༈༘༰༨་༺༫༮༵༼༼༧༓༉༫༳༦ༀ༸༃༕༼༃༃༮༮༰༅༨༾༜༴༨༑༁ༀ༅༛༓༼༪༽༳༶༔༷༃༅༵༒༰༶༂༴༠༦༚༆༿༽༌༤༭༑༵༜༛༹༆༛༮༙༇༚༬༳༦༴ༀ༉༂༒༮༗༑༮༱༷༣</div>"},{"id":"marker190","name":"Shemnes Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠊𐠏 \udc1c\ud802 \ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠄\ud802𐠃\udc0b\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠜𐠸\udc24𐠃\udc11\udc0e\udc2b𐠮\udc33\udc0e\ud802𐠠\udc2b\udc2e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟 \udc05\udc14\ud802\ud802𐠗 \udc0b\ud802𐠯\ud802𐠒\udc23\udc2a\ud802𐠌 \ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker191","name":"Unbund Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከገሀጰፐፐነተጠከጸደ ወበፐዐተለቀ ፀየሠፐፈጸበዘሐሀሀሐጰየኀዘተአ ፈ ዘከለሰሰአ አወሰፀ የፀረ ፀዘጸፀተደ ገአ ተፈነመደጰመከጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker192","name":"Tuzaddzar Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠖\ud802𐠏𐠓𐠔𐠣\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠈\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠮\udc12\udc16\udc34𐠼\ud802𐠍\ud802𐠤\ud802\ud802 \udc1f\udc01\udc19\ud802𐠔\ud802𐠭\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠎\udc0a𐠥\udc1b\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠂\udc20𐠑\udc1c\udc3c𐠌\ud802𐠝\udc22\udc21\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc12𐠯\udc0e\ud802\ud802 𐠗𐠛\udc1f\udc35 \ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker193","name":"Kharb Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡟᡯᠵᢒᡠᡕᢒᡙᡔᢢ᠀ᡖᡗᢑᠼᠭᠽᢦᡍᠲᡔᠾ᠐ᡑᢠᡓᠿᡭᢀᢞᢡᡕᠯᢑᡑᢠᡕᡭᡁᢒᡯᢋᡀᠮᠧᠭ᠑ᡯᡗᡱᡕᢐᢐᡒ᠑ᢐᡒᡜᠽᢑᠠᢞᢞᡮᡮᠿᡰᠮᡏᡜᠪᠯᡑᡗᢋ᠐ᡟᠡᠩᡀᢡᢒᠳᠾᡜᠡᡴᢂᢑᠿᢦ</div>"},{"id":"marker194","name":"Gathur Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⲲⲴ⳪ⳭⲼⲸⲸⲺⳂⳃⳐⳌⳚⲸⲲ⳾Ⳃ ⲴⳚⳚⳆⳐⳤ⳩ⳄⳔⲼⳫⳤⳂ⳪ ⳾ⳬⳢⳃ ⳥ⳚⳄⳂⳚⲸⳈⳤⳞⳌⲼⳌⳂⳄ ⳄⳖⳒⳭⳊⳁⳬⲲⳂⳠⲶ ⳢⳒⳔⳜⳐ ⳎⳲⲴ⳹Ⳛⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker195","name":"Chughird Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸሀ ጠለጰሀሀ ፀፐ ለረተፀ ለኀ መሠ የነ ጠኀኀ ዘጸደዘየ ለጰደአጠገ ጸበጠጰፈበበወ ተፀየገቀ ተኀደወረተዘየጰለዘፀዐአአተለዘዐፈገሰ</div>"},{"id":"marker196","name":"Umunzdus Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠰᠽᠩᢛᢒᠼᡏᢥᡴᠾ᠑ᠡᢦᡳᢞᠲᡯᡗᠮᡖᠡᡁᡏᠦᡯ᠑ᢤ᠒ᡱᡔᠰᢏᡟᢛᡓᡖ᠑ᠮᡭᡕᡭᢁᢀᡏᠧᢒᠻᡮᠠᠱ</div>"},{"id":"marker197","name":"Mondfordge Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༨༷༨༪༱༕༩༵༺༸༆༾༯༰༷༺༩༭༭༦༻༙༽༽༢༇༑༄༇༯༓༗༉༤༚༚༶༇༫༻༂༧༡༚༉༬༽༡༭༙༑༃༼༯༓༦༮་༚་༔༃༙༁༾༸༲༦༴༜</div>"},{"id":"marker198","name":"Unzargazir Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡆᠨᢢᡏᢁᢀᡭᠻᠪ᠀ᡡᡮᠳᡝᡠᡝᡙᡍᠻᢁᡮᢢᡝᠻᡒᡀ᠒᠒ᡟᠰᡙ᠐ᠳᠱᡴᠲᡔᠩᢡᢛᠲᢜᡎᠭ᠀ᠻᠳᢐᡮᠱᡠᡴᢓᠾᡳᠻᢐᡟᢥᠰᢡᡟᠵᡱᡮᡍᠿᢥᡯᠪᡡᡠᠠᡡᠯᡓᡍᠨᠵᠾᠩᢞ</div>"},{"id":"marker199","name":"Nulgathun Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༚༒༦༰༄༕༳༉༐༾༖༮༓༐༷༆༜༌༭༄༭༗༹༪༕༴༙༆༲༃༊༢་་༖༥༪༱༔༳༳༵༑༈༺༩༉༜༔༜༐༫༵༦༯༩༄༸༴༼༶༥༣༴༳༙</div>"},{"id":"marker200","name":"Gazdroz Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲾⲶⳄⳎⳢⳖⲸⳎⳈⳀⳆⳔ⳥⳹ⳞⳈⲼ ⳪ Ⲽ⳩ⳄⲴⲼⳫ⳧ⳖⳎⳈⳭⲾⳫⲸⲶⲺⳃⲲ Ⲷ⳹⳾ⳒⳔⳲⳲ⳧ⳀⳫⳆⲼⳀⳚⲾⳎⳒⳖ⳾⳾ⲾⳀⳈⲺⳁ⳾ⳤⲶ ⳜⳖⳄ⳾</div>"},{"id":"marker201","name":"Mithsedil Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠪᡠᢐ᠑ᢁᢡᠩᢢᡐᡟᢡᡜᢓᡐᠪᠩᠭᠮᡗᡏᢦᠮᡆᡔᢒᡝᢟᠧᢋᡒᢓᠠᡎᡝᢛᡞᡱᡱᢓᡱ᠑ᢁᠲᠾ</div>"},{"id":"marker202","name":"Balereach Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠜\udc33𐠨𐠂\udc13\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠦\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠛\ud802𐠟𐠅\udc29\udc12\ud802𐠯\udc0f\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc1a \udc0a𐠅\udc0b\udc3f</div>"},{"id":"marker203","name":"Gazdrukh Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢤᡁᠯᠡᠠᠠᠦᠾᢢᢐᡁᠽᠡ᠑ᡗ᠑ᠯᠩᢤᢓᢜᡓᠯᡏᠧᠲ᠐ᢏᡆᡐᡴᠵᢁᢟᢦᡐᡑᡀ᠀ᠨᡔ᠐᠒ᢋᡎᠧᢡᡯᡴ</div>"},{"id":"marker204","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ru